Package: homelab-drive-web-ui
Architecture: all
Depends: perl (>= 5.36),
         libmojolicious-perl,
         libyaml-libyaml-perl
Description: Web interface for Homelab Drive
 A Mojolicious web application providing a browser-based interface to the
 Homelab Drive file storage service. Serves at drive.example.com,
 proxying API calls to api.example.com. Supports htmx-driven file
 browsing, drag-and-drop upload, folder navigation, and file management.
